  "description": "Succeeded by the Roadrat Gen4.\n\nThe third generation Roadrat was our swift and rugged flat bar flyer.\n\nFaster than a mountain bike on the road, way more fun and versatile than a traditional road bike, the Roadrat was the perfect 'other' bike: a Cotic Life Bike. Swift and rugged, it was born of a desire for something to take on the crumbling tarmac of the urban landscape, but just as happy disappearing for a few days with nothing but a sleeping bag and mat for company. Road, gravel, commute, adventures: it took you to work, to the shops, on holiday, to the hills, or just to that quiet place where you get some headspace.\n\nSizes: Small, Medium and Large. Wheels: 700c.",
